  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue: \n\nA lot of settings have switched to being a looping selector with the new Main Menu Settings Tab. While I think this is fine for a few of the settings, a lot of other ones would make more sense as a drop down instead. \n\nAs of right now it's quite annoying to get to the settings / value you wanted, as you first need to cycle through a lot of other options first.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nPlease consider replacing most / if not all of the looping selectors with drop downs.\n\nDrop downs allow you to see all of the available options at once without having to cycle through them first, which is why I think they are a better choice for most of the available settings.",
